{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日暑い日が続いてますが、皆さん体調大丈夫ですか?\n熱中症怖いからちゃんと水飲んで気をつけてくださいね〜🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の ゆうがたパラダイス、お聞きいただいた皆さんありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうパラさんは有難いことに何回も出させて頂いてますが、毎回毎回本当に楽しくて…😭✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの大好きな場所です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金田さんも毎回優しくて面白くて毎度沢山笑ってしまいます☺️😂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん、そして金田さん、本当に素敵な方とお仕事させていただけて有難いです "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出演できる日を楽しみにしています\n皆さんも是非、毎週お聴き逃しなく!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、最近ずっと料理してるのですが、ブログ更新忘れておりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうパラさんで話した、いなり寿司とまぜそばは また載せますね👌🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜は、リゾットに初挑戦しました🍽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP2415JT1EA6AAEVQWKACW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*キノコとパルミジャーノレジャーノのリゾット*ヴィシソワーズ*彩り野菜とチーズのサラダ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リゾットにはパルミジャーノレジャーノ チーズを"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP254S68N1M65MEQ1VDZDA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP267MEDEMMQ0SBJTDRSEN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バターで、刻みにんにくを炒めて香りが出てきたらきのこを。そこに水をさっといれて軽く火を通したら白ワインを。水気が無くなるまでじっくりと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後はパルミジャーノを入れて 完成"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP27974PH9805SK4XT2MFN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nヴィシソワーズは、じゃがいもと玉ねぎで。煮立ったら 牛乳を加えて、最後はフードプロセッサーで形が無くなるまで。冷蔵庫で冷やして 完成!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP28AYAZ76T0KMMM9VCCYD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ、握手会ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いので皆さん気をつけてお越し下さい🙃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYP29CY0MRC7TH64K848BRY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織"},{"type":"break"}],"source":"archive"}